{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>為配合旅發局今年首度舉辦的「萬聖月」，尖東一連3個星期六，將舉行萬聖節派對。</p><p></p><p>派對在尖東麼地道花園舉行，嘩鬼隨音樂起舞，3日派對各有主題，包括萬聖節電音派對、動漫以及電影角色，會有DJ現場打碟。市民及旅客可按主題「扮鬼扮馬」參加。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN-2200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Kns7eylvnk1792077457.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>現場設巨型萬聖節吹氣公仔和霓虹招牌裝置，方便「打卡」。亦有遊戲攤位等。場內有售賣街頭小食及萬聖節特色飲品的小型市集。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN-2200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wQmalkpwHN1792077473.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN-2200_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OpW8FRjKch1792077489.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>未來兩個星期六，派對會在下午4時至晚上10時舉行，到「正日」亦即萬聖節前夕，就會延長至晚上11時。免費入場。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN-2200_007.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VnB9b899vx1792077507.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:49.740859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:37:40.936884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:14.738192+00:00","content_hash":"69341d2703fa08e575e91a52383dedf74b1e0ffbc8e632bbd991ad2b610196fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}